                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This was a fine puzzle game. The story was cute and whimsical though some cutscenes take a bit too long. Overall I enjoyed my time with the game. You can brute force it for most of the levels, and you could of course follow a guide for most levels though there are a few puzzles that defy having a guide. The rules of the puzzles are well laid out and easy to understand. Give this one a shot if you like puzzle games.",
